Subject: Chat Workbench Chapter Directory Justification
Date: 2026-05-14
Scope: The Lounge embedded Nicks/Chapters directory navigation

& [ChatWorkbenchChapterDirectorySlice] is the selectable chapter navigation behavior for the embedded directory frame
  + [specification_basis] is AlienHand/docs/irc-chat-refinement.sop
  + [processed_specification_basis] is AlienHand/docs/sjs/exploded/irc-chat-refinement.v2.exploded.sop
  + [ui_contract] is [ComponentContract: DirectoryFrame]
  + [thelounge_commit] is 2fe0c6da
  + [parent_pointer] is AlienHand/thelounge
  + [implementation_files] are The Lounge client/components/AlienHandRefinementWorkbench.vue and client/css/alienhand-chat.css
  + [proof_file] is AlienHand/python/alienhand_ai/payload_http.py

  = implemented: converted Chapters tab rows from static text into selectable navigation buttons
  = implemented: tracked selectedChapterId as transient UI state, not durable source truth
  = implemented: highlighted the selected chapter card in Editing when visible
  = implemented: made chapter selection reveal the first available source cut and source chat block when possible
  = implemented: reset selected chapter state when the workbench changes channel
  = implemented: added directory item styles with hover, focus, and selected states
  = implemented: expanded runtime proof bundle and style markers for chapter directory selection
  = satisfies: [ComponentContract: DirectoryFrame] because chapter entries now support selection and source navigation rather than acting as inert labels
  = satisfies: [ConversationEditingProjection] because chapter navigation points back to source cut and source chat evidence when available
  = satisfies: DataDrivenDesign accidental-state discipline because selectedChapterId remains UI-only and persisted chapter rows stay authoritative
  = verification: npx eslint client/components/AlienHandRefinementWorkbench.vue --color passed
  = verification: yarn prettier --check client/components/AlienHandRefinementWorkbench.vue client/css/alienhand-chat.css passed
  = verification: yarn build:client passed
  = verification: python -m compileall AlienHand\python\alienhand_ai\payload_http.py passed
  = verification: python -m alienhand_ai.cli chat-workbench-runtime-proof --output runs --name chat-workbench-chapter-directory-proof --timeout 45 returned workbench_runtime_ok true
  - deferred: browser visual review should confirm whether selected chapter highlighting feels strong enough inside the wide layout
  - never: make the selected directory chapter the storage truth for chapter membership
